  "notes": [
    "**Olvidar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **olvidado** (regular)",
    "Often used reflexively: **olvidarse (de)** = to forget (about)",
    "Common usage:",
    "*Olvidé mis llaves* (I forgot my keys)",
    "*Me olvidé de llamarte* (I forgot to call you)",
    "*No olvides* (Don't forget)",
    "Opposite: **recordar** (to remember)",
    "Related noun: **el olvido** (forgetfulness, oblivion)",
    "Expression: *echar en olvido* (to cast into oblivion)"
